null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["是一家只有吧台座位，小而美高cp值的拉麵店，用餐人數算多需要稍微排隊等候。\n湯頭有兩種選擇魚介和豚骨湯，魚介湯屬清爽型有點蝦米柴魚風味，清甜爽口，今天點蔥花拉麵老闆蔥花給的很有誠意，但稍微搶味，所以湯頭建議可以選濃郁選項。另一碗點的是豚骨金沢拉麵濃郁口味，湯頭有點鹹但沒有豚骨湯的香醇口感，有點可惜。\n但餐點裡整顆的溏心蛋，製作入味非常好吃。叉燒肉也不同於其他店家那種富含油脂軟嫩型，本店是油脂少滷製入味且有嚼勁那種，份量也算足量。而且內用可以免費續麵飯，是家高cp值的店。",null,[0,150]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7893380568511255014/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhTTm1KWGFHcGpWWEJNVmxWb2Rsb3dkRXBVVlhCSldtdDRSMWRHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7893380568511255014/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhTTm1KWGFHcGpWWEJNVmxWb2Rsb3dkRXBVVlhCSldtdDRSMWRHUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7893380568511255014/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhTTm1KWGFHcGpWWEJNVmxWb2Rsb3dkRXBVVlhCSldtdDRSMWRHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7893380568511255014/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhTTm1KWGFHcGpWWEJNVmxWb2Rsb3dkRXBVVlhCSldtdDRSMWRHUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7893380568511255014/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhTTm1KWGFHcGpWWEJNVmxWb2Rsb3dkRXBVVlhCSldtdDRSMWRHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7893380568511255014/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhTTm1KWGFHcGpWWEJNVmxWb2Rsb3dkRXBVVlhCSldtdDRSMWRHUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,1131,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xSNmJXaGpjVXBMVlVodlowdEpUVXBJWmt4R1dGRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xcb15d355dde48722!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlR6bWhjcUpLVUhvZ0tJTUpIZkxGWFE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xSNmJXaGpjVXBMVlVodlowdEpUVXBJWmt4R1dGRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xSNmJXaGpjVXBMVlVodlowdEpUVXBJWmt4R1dGRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xSNmJXaGpjVXBMVlVodlowdEpU