，沒有讓人很驚艷的地方。不過，魚介湯是台北唯一有的特色店家，想嚐鮮的可以來試試看，但老實說，我個人認為喝起來很起來很像某種台南的海鮮湯，讓我覺得很出戲，沒辦法當作是道地的拉麵來享用，真要說的話，我倒還覺得豚骨湯比較好喝一點。\n\n麵條的部分是細麵，即便我選軟麵了，我還是覺得麵很不吸湯，我覺得湯麵是分離的，沒有辦法融合在一起，這一點實在是大扣分。至於湯頭的部分，並不是常見的濃稠感，而是偏向清水感，這應該麵不吸湯汁的主要原因吧，雖然豚骨湯有寫會濃稠一些，但個人覺得還是遠不及其他豚骨系拉麵的口感！！！！\n\n我覺得嚐鮮或CP值的話可以來吃吃，但要再訪的話，個人完全不會再考慮。",null,[0,102]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7893380568511255014/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRuZWxaSVJqUlRNRGxXV2xSS1UxWnRNREJrUm5CaFkwWTRlbU51WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7893380568511255014/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRuZWxaSVJqUlRNRGxXV2xSS1UxWnRNREJrUm5CaFkwWTRlbU51WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7893380568511255014/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRuZWxaSVJqUlRNRGxXV2xSS1UxWnRNREJrUm5CaFkwWTRlbU51WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7893380568511255014/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRuZWxaSVJqUlRNRGxXV2xSS1UxWnRNREJrUm5CaFkwWTRlbU51WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7893380568511255014/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRuZWxaSVJqUlRNRGxXV2xSS1UxWnRNREJrUm5CaFkwWTRlbU51WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7893380568511255014/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRuZWxaSVJqUlRNRGxXV2xSS1UxWnRNREJrUm5CaFkwWTRlbU51WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,23610,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tnelZIRjRTMDlWWlRKU1ZtMDBkRnBhY0Y4emNuYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xcb15d355dde48722!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkgzVHF4S09VZTJSVm00dFpacF8zcnc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tnelZIRjRTMDlWWlRKU1ZtMDBkRnBhY0Y4emNuYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tnelZIRjRTMDlWWlRKU1ZtMDBkRnBhY0Y4emNuYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT